  <item>
    <title>Ep16.我以旋律作锚，画出了记忆深处的那个夏天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6673093db6a8412729f6be0e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6673093db6a8412729f6be0e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jun 2024 16:37:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上上期kino谈到了嗅觉，那么这一期小比就来谈谈听觉。</span></p><p><span>一段时间耳机里循环播放的音乐，在下一次随机切到时，总是让我们想起那段时间的点点滴滴。</span></p><p><span>【timeline】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a>循环的歌曲是一段记忆的锚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a>暗时间与耳机内的并行世界</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1451">24:11</a>音乐软件的年末总结回忆轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1573">26:13</a>史铁生《病隙碎笔》和余华《往事与刑罚》中对我有所启发的两句话</span></p><p><span>【bgm】</span></p><p><span>琥珀色的素肌——tonun</span></p><p><span>Shape Of You——Ed Sheeran</span></p><p><span>Closer——The Chanisomkers</span></p><p><span>光年之外——邓紫棋</span></p><p><span>Jump——Tyla/Gunna/Skillibeng</span></p><p><span>Summer Too Hot——Chris Brown</span></p><p><span>All I Wanna Do—Jay Park</span></p><p><span>Hate You——Ph1/禹元材</span></p><p><span>Self Love——Metro Boom/Con Leray</span></p><p><span>Calm Down——Rema</span></p><p><span><a data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0bhg2HX3YMilHueW_eKqtw" href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0bhg2HX3YMilHueW_eKqtw">mp.weixin.qq.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls99ki3pUYvOtxcIAEyXSFj7PvRc.m4a" length="32401986" type="audio/mp4"/>
