    <pubDate>Tue, 21 May 2024 08:28:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“敏感”的人总是能很好的感知自然。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你听到最后，请不要错过bgm里的笛声。在citypop的律动里，我又闻到了太阳、泡泡、风和树叶，那股初夏热热的味道。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoP3HFJfFmLhnhpQ7dyQw_K92oau.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft4JkiqfwRgQFMbXeWQoAZEyRRHn.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FobmVfBlrY4SbQLlluwFyPzLLfoQ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>【timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">1:35</a> watermelon sugar high～～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">2:46</a> 草香和任何天气都适配</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">5:38</a> 香料才是食物的灵魂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">8:47</a> 专治本人赖床的早餐香气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 茶咖酒的相通之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">15:12</a> 皂感？苔藓的味道？一些复刻生活的香型</span></p><span></span><p><span>【bgm】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hype Boy Citypop Mashup - Marukaobeats</span></p><span></span><p><span>春雪 - 10cm</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bubble gum - NewJeans</span></p><span></span><p><span>【阅读】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《闻树的十三种方式》——戴维·乔治·哈斯凯尔</span></p>]]></description>
